Package: cavefindr
Title: Detect Cave Entrances from Airborne LiDAR Point Clouds
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Afonso", "Rodrigues", , "afonsobm5@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to locate, correct, and predict cave entrance locations
    from airborne LiDAR (LAS/LAZ) point clouds. Provides functions to
    inspect point cloud coordinates, correct GPS error in a known cave
    database using ground-plane geometry, train a random forest classifier
    on curated cave regions of interest, and generate new candidate cave
    entrance predictions (via simple thresholds or the trained model) with
    optional interactive case-by-case review.
